Value Required PEER_LDP_IDENT (\S+)
Value LOCAL_LDP_IDENT (\S+)
Value STATE (\w+)
Value MSGS_SENT (\d+)
Value MSGS_RCVD (\d+)
Value UPTIME (\S+)

Start
  ^\s*Peer LDP Ident: ${PEER_LDP_IDENT}; Local LDP Ident ${LOCAL_LDP_IDENT}\s*$$
  ^\s*State: ${STATE}; Msgs sent/rcvd: ${MSGS_SENT}/${MSGS_RCVD};
  ^\s*Up time: ${UPTIME}\s*$$ -> Record
